        },
        {
          "text": "Enyegesa ye ekahuniriza abantu, habwokuba akabeegesa nk'anyakwina obusobozi, atabeegese nk'abeegesa b'ebiragiro oku baabeegesaaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu isorrokaniro eri hakaba harumu omusaija akwasirwe omwoyo mubi: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yatokera haiguru naagamba ati: “Yesu owa Nazareeti nootwenza ki? Oizire kutuhwerekereza? Ninkumanya, niiwe ahikiriire wa Ruhanga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu Yesu yagucoomera ati: “Culeera, murugeho!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omwoyo omubi gwamukankaniza, gwayamuliza haiguru, gwamurugaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu boona baatangaara, nukwo kukaguzangana bati: “Kinu kiki? Enu nyegesa mpyaka! Naaragiza obusobozi emyoyo emibi, nayo neemuhurra.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahonaaho yagenda naayeyongera kurangaanwa omu bicweka byona ebya Galiraaya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu naakiza nyinazaara Simooni",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obu baarugire omu isorrokaniro, baataaha omu nju ya Simooni na Andereya, bali hamu na Yakobbo na Yohaana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyinazaara Simooni akaba abyamire, arwaire omuswija obu akaba naakyahikaho ati, baamumugambira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu yaija, yamukwata ha mukono, yamwimukya; omuswija gwamurugaho; yatandika kubaheereza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwebagyo, izooba obu lyagwire, bakamuleetera boona abakaba barwaire n'abakwasirwe emyoyo emibi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ab'omu rubuga boona bakeesorooleza ha mulyango. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakiza baingi abakaba barwaire endwara ezitali zimu; yabinga emyoyo emibi nyingi, kandi atagiikirize kugamba, habwokuba ekamumanya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu naarangirra Amakuru Amarungi omu Galiraaya yoona",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyenkya akaimuka obwire butakakiire, yagenda omu kiikaro ekitarumu bantu, yasabirayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Simooni n'abo aba akaba ainabo baija nibamuserra, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "obu baamugwireho baamugambira bati: “Boona nibakuserra.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe yabagarukamu ati: “Tweyongereyo omu byaro ebindi ebiherraineho, naho nyegeseeyo; habwokuba nikyo kyandeesire.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.4.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 4:23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.9.35"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "9:35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yagenda naaraba omu Galiraaya yoona, naarangirra omu masorrokaniro gaabu, kandi naabinga emyoyo emibi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu naakiza omugenge",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omugenge akaija nambere ali, yateeza amaju naamwesengereza ati: “Obu oraaba noogonza, noosobora kunkiza.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu yakwatwa embabazi, yagorra omukono, yamukwataho, namugambira ati: “Ego ningonza; kira.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu kasumi ako konyini ebigenge byamurugaho, yakira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahonaaho Yesu yamuragira agende, naamuteererra muno ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.14.1+LEV.14.2+LEV.14.3+LEV.14.4+LEV.14.5+LEV.14.6+LEV.14.7+LEV.14.8+LEV.14.9+LEV.14.10+LEV.14.11+LEV.14.12+LEV.14.13+LEV.14.14+LEV.14.15+LEV.14.16+LEV.14.17+LEV.14.18+LEV.14.19+LEV.14.20+LEV.14.21+LEV.14.22+LEV.14.23+LEV.14.24+LEV.14.25+LEV.14.26+LEV.14.27+LEV.14.28+LEV.14.29+LEV.14.30+LEV.14.31+LEV.14.32"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lev 14:1-32",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Otakisura okakigambiraho omuntu n'omu, baitu genda oyeyoleke nyakatagara, kandi habw'okusemezibwa kwawe oheyo ekihongwa Musa eki yaragiire, bube bwakaiso hali abantu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 1:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu obu yaturukire aheeru, yatandika kwebaliza naabirarangya hoona; nahabweki Yesu akaba atakyasobora kugaruka kutaaha omu byaro burole, baitu akaikara ha rubaju; abantu baarugaga hoona hoona, nibamusangayo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.1.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.1.45"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
